WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.960
Sam: Lucky can do lots of things.

2
00:00:07.961 --> 00:00:10.590
Karen: Really? Like what?

3
00:00:10.591 --> 00:00:13.852
Sam: We'll show you.

4
00:00:13.853 --> 00:00:19.925
Sam: Lucky, roll

5
00:00:19.926 --> 00:00:22.923
over! Good boy.

6
00:00:22.924 --> 00:00:31.058
Karen: He's covered in dirt now.

7
00:00:31.059 --> 00:00:34.830
Sam: Lucky can fetch too.

8
00:00:34.831 --> 00:00:38.927
Karen: Fetch what?

9
00:00:38.928 --> 00:00:43.048
Sam: He can fetch sticks.

10
00:00:43.049 --> 00:01:01.303
Sam: Watch this. Lucky, fetch!

11
00:01:01.304 --> 00:01:05.143
Karen: He upset the chickens!

12
00:01:05.144 --> 00:01:16.377
Sam: Sorry. He didn't mean to do

13
00:01:16.378 --> 00:01:20.177
that. Sam: He fetched the stick

14
00:01:20.178 --> 00:01:23.284
though. Karen: Big

15
00:01:23.285 --> 00:01:30.783
deal. Fetching and rolling over are just tricks.

16
00:01:30.784 --> 00:01:36.253
Karen: Buddy does real work with the sheep.

17
00:01:36.254 --> 00:01:41.314
Sam: We don't have any

18
00:01:41.315 --> 00:01:45.646
sheep. Karen: Buddy watches the farm at night

19
00:01:45.647 --> 00:01:49.438
too. What does Lucky do at night?

20
00:01:49.439 --> 00:01:57.108
Sam: He just sleeps in my room.

21
00:01:57.109 --> 00:02:00.006
Karen: Lucky is cute.

22
00:02:00.007 --> 00:02:04.152
But he doesn't do any jobs.

23
00:02:04.153 --> 00:02:09.367
Sam: Lucky has one important job. He—

24
00:02:09.368 --> 00:02:22.302
Karen: Oh! I hear the lunch bell. Let's go eat!

